  "releaseNotes": "⚙️ **Modifications**\n- Refactored specialized invokers into thin wrappers over `ProcessInvoker` + middleware.\n- Forwarded the full process configuration in both platform middleware.\n- Cleaned up `PowershellInvoker`; updated `PowershellProcessInvoker`, `PlatformMiddlewareExtensions`, and `EnvironmentVariablesBuilder`.\n- Ensured standard-output redirection is disabled when shell execution is used.\n- Added the call operator to the PowerShell-wrapped command.\n\n🐛 **Bug Fixes**\n- Fixed XML doc comments to reference correct class names.",
